<title>
Scan Tool Active Test Table
</title>
<ptxt>
SUZUKI scan tool includes output test function which can force operation of the following actuators and relays of systems controlled by BCM. When a malfunction is found in system controlled by BCM, execute output test to facilitate judgment of whether the malfunction is on the input or output side of BCM. For details of SUZUKI scan tool, refer to its Operator&apos;s Manual.
</ptxt>
